OL,3,ANew wave of bomb threats hit European
OL,4,Aairlines
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean airlines have again been hit
OL,7,Fwith a new wave of bomb threats - in
OL,8,Fthe third such incident this week.
OL,10,FOn Friday multiple flights to and from
OL,11,FLisbon, Rome, Prague and Sofia were
OL,12,Ftargeted and the threats saw three
OL,13,Fplanes escorted by Hungarian fighter
OL,14,Fjets, authorities said.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
