OL,3,ANew wave of bomb threats hit European
OL,4,Aairlines
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also saw a number of high-profile
OL,7,Fmedia organisations, including
OL,8,FIreland's public broadcaster RTE,
OL,9,Fevacuated after threats were made
OL,10,Fagainst them - although there has been
OL,11,Fno concrete links between the messages
OL,12,Fagainst airlines and the broadcasters
OL,13,Fyet.
OL,15,FThe disruption comes after nearly 30
OL,16,Faircraft and several airports across
OL,17,FEurope were impacted by bomb threats
OL,18,Fearlier this week, in what the UK
OL,19,Fcalled a "malicious hoax".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
